#. Lektion im Kurs „9. Lust und Körperwissen mit Vulva“
#. EN: The idea still persists that the clitoris is a small point at the top of the labia. In fact, the visible part is only the tip.
#. EN:
#. EN: Why it works
#. EN: The clitoris has visible and internal parts; its shape and size vary between bodies. Its legs and bulbs reach deep into the tissue beneath the labia and surround the vaginal entrance. Like the penis, it consists of tissue that fills with blood.
#. EN: During arousal, blood flow and sensitivity change. How much time you want for comfortable touch is individual and can vary from day to day. You do not have to reach a particular anatomical state or be ready after a set number of minutes.
