#. Lektion im Kurs „9. Lust und Körperwissen mit Vulva“
#. EN: An experience can bring curiosity and leave questions behind. With squirting, images and claims often crowd out the space for your own response. This lesson grew from a community question and separates what is known from what remains open.
#. EN:
#. EN: Few topics come with as many claims as squirting. Here is what is established and what stays open.
#. EN:
#. EN: Three terms that often get mixed up
#. EN: Female ejaculation means a few millilitres of a thicker, milky secretion from the Skene glands next to the urethra. Squirting means a gush of clear, thin fluid, often ten millilitres or more. Coital incontinence is unwanted loss of urine during sex, a symptom of bladder and pelvic floor that can be treated. From the inside the lines cannot be drawn reliably. What matters is whether it bothers you.
#. EN:
#. EN: What studies found
