#. EN: First, preparation: using the toilet and cleaning the outer skin can be part of preparation; a shower does not clean the rectum. Fingernails short and smooth, hands washed. A disposable glove gives many people a sense of safety. Use plenty of lubricant, because the rectum doesn't lubricate itself.
