#. EN: Pain always means: stop. Never insert anything into the anus that doesn't have a flared base and isn't made for it – objects without a stop can slip into the bowel. If you use toys, choose an undamaged toy designed for anal use, with a secure stopper, and follow the manufacturer's guidance. After anal contact, wash hands or toys before they touch the vulva or mouth. With a partner: only at their explicit wish, and stoppable at any time.
#. EN:
#. EN: When to see a doctor
#. EN: With haemorrhoids, fissures, acute inflammation, after operations in the pelvic area or with persistent pain, ask a doctor first.
msgctxt "lesson:prost_3#content"
msgid ""
"Wenn du – allein oder zu zweit – neugierig bist, die Prostata direkt zu erkunden, entscheiden drei Dinge über eine gute Erfahrung: Vorbereitung, Entspannung und Langsamkeit.\n"
