#. Lektion im Kurs „16. Alltagserotik: Lust zwischen Kaffee und Kalender“
#. EN: A word only the two of you understand can briefly change an ordinary day. A glance, a smile you try to hide: playful eroticism can live in this small shared understanding. The following ideas give it a place in daily life.
