#. EN: Sensuality in everyday life
#. EN: The shower: not rushed, but a few minutes with warm water on your skin and a shower gel that smells good.
#. EN: Clothes: wearing something you feel good in, even on perfectly ordinary days.
#. EN: Music: a song that moves you, and moving to it, alone in the kitchen.
#. EN: Food: eating slowly, tasting, smelling. Enjoyment is a skill you can practise.
#. EN: Touch: putting on lotion as if you were someone you like.
#. EN:
