#. EN: Touching yourself isn't a substitute for sex with another person, but its own form of closeness to yourself. If you know what you like, you can show it. And if you regularly allow yourself pleasure, you often feel more alive in everyday life too.
#. EN:
#. EN: The task
#. EN: This week, plan an hour just for you and your body: a bath, music, candles, lotion, and if you like, the guided body journey below this lesson. Treat it like a date you're looking forward to.
#. EN:
#. EN: In a relationship
#. EN: Time with yourself is valuable in a partnership too. You can talk together about making room for both personal time and time as a couple. Many couples find that their own desire enlivens their shared desire as well.
