#. EN: When the eyes are covered, attention shifts to touch, hearing and smell. Many people then experience touch as much more intense – a single breath on the skin can suddenly feel electric. At the same time, the spectator trap from course 4 has hardly anything left to see and judge. And not knowing what comes next keeps you completely in the moment.
