#. EN: External vibrators and wand vibrators are placed on the outside: on the clitoris and labia, on the glans, shaft, perineum, nipples, or all over the body as a massage. An external model can offer a straightforward beginning if its size and intensity suit you. Small ones for travel are called bullets, large wand massagers deliver strong, deep vibration.
