#. EN: Vibrators and dildos for insertion come in different sizes, shapes and firmness. Curved models aim at the front wall of the vagina, where many people have an especially sensitive zone. Love balls are not training devices in a medical sense. For pelvic floor problems, physiotherapy helps more than any gadget, more on that in course 7.
