#. EN: For couples
#. EN: Couples' vibrators wrap around both partners or sit between the bodies, vibrating rings are worn by the man, massage candles and oils are sensual starters. Even a blindfold or a feather is a toy.
#. EN:
#. EN: The task
#. EN: Pick two kinds that make you curious and just look online at what they look like and what they are for. You don't have to buy anything. This is about orientation.
msgctxt "lesson:toys_2#content"
msgid ""
