#. Lektion im Kurs „25. Toys: Spielzeug mit Köpfchen“
#. EN: A good toy needs appropriate use. Shape, material and application belong together, and some products call for closer attention. This lesson helps you check the important points before trying them.
#. EN:
#. EN: Anal toys
#. EN: In the bottom, one iron rule applies: only toys with a wide base or handle that stays outside. The rectum has no floor, and an object without a base can slide in so far that it can't be grasped any more. Then only the emergency room helps, and it is there for exactly this, without blame.
#. EN: Start small and with plenty of lubricant. The sphincter needs time. Breathe out deeply as you insert and stop at pain. Numbing gels are off limits, because pain is the warning you need.
#. EN:
#. EN: No household objects
#. EN: Bottles, vegetables, pens, hairbrushes and the like are not toys. They are too hard, too rough, cannot be cleaned or break. Objects like these can cause injury or become stuck.
#. EN:
#. EN: Penis rings
#. EN: A penis ring should be stretchy and soft, ideally silicone, not rigid metal. It comes off after twenty to thirty minutes at most, and immediately if there is coldness, numbness, pain or discolouration. Small sizes are dangerous: if the ring won't come off, that is an emergency. Anyone taking blood thinners or with circulation problems asks their doctor first.
#. EN: If an erection lasts longer than four hours or hurts, go to the emergency room.
#. EN:
#. EN: Vacuum pumps and strong suction toys
#. EN: They may only be used briefly and with little vacuum. Skin changes, bruising or pain are reasons to pause and review use; seek medical advice for persistent symptoms.
#. EN:
#. EN: Vibration and habituation
#. EN: Permanent top speed can dull sensitivity for a while. Give yourself breaks and vary the intensity.
#. EN:
#. EN: Devices and power
#. EN: Don't charge batteries in the heat and dispose of damaged devices. Never use battery toys with leaked batteries. Electro-stimulation toys don't belong near the heart or head, and certainly not in beginners' hands.
#. EN:
#. EN: The task
#. EN: Make yourself a safety list: lubricant ready, toy clean, base on anal toys, a time limit for rings, a phone within reach. That takes the worry away in the moment itself.
msgctxt "lesson:toys_4#content"
msgid ""
"Ein gutes Toy braucht einen passenden Umgang. Form, Material und Anwendung gehören zusammen, und bei manchen Produkten ist ein genauer Blick besonders wichtig. Diese Lektion hilft dir, die entscheidenden Punkte vor dem Ausprobieren zu klären.\n"
