#. Lektion im Kurs „25. Toys: Spielzeug mit Köpfchen“
#. EN: With toys, quality pays. Cheap goods from dubious sources are often made of poor material and offer no safety.
#. EN:
#. EN: Where to buy
#. EN: Reputable specialist shops and online stores with an imprint, return policy and clear material information. Many ship in plain packaging with an inconspicuous sender. Read the actual material and care information. Terms such as “body-safe” alone do not demonstrate independent testing. If a price seems too good to be true, be careful.
#. EN:
#. EN: What to check
#. EN: Size and weight, noise level (quiet motors are a blessing in thin-walled flats), rechargeable or battery, waterproofing, a travel lock against accidental switching on, and whether parts can be exchanged or replaced.
#. EN:
#. EN: Start small
#. EN: Your first toy doesn't have to be the most expensive or the biggest. A small, well-made external vibrator is often enough to find out whether you like vibration at all.
#. EN:
#. EN: Storing it discreetly
#. EN: A cloth bag in a drawer or box, not lying open in the bedside table, especially when children or guests are around. Anything that needs power is stored so it can't switch on by accident. Put lubricant and cleaner with it, so everything is in one place.
#. EN:
#. EN: App toys and remote control
#. EN: Toys with Bluetooth or an app can be controlled from afar. That is tempting but raises privacy questions: read what data the app collects, don't use accounts with your real name, and only give access to people you trust. Connections over the internet can be intercepted if they are not encrypted. Short Bluetooth range does not guarantee privacy; the particular app, its permissions and connection security matter.
#. EN:
#. EN: When you no longer need it
#. EN: Toys are not given away or resold, but cleaned and thrown out with household waste, or, if they contain a battery, taken to an electronics collection point.
#. EN:
#. EN: The task
#. EN: Write down what your first toy should do, a budget and two things it must never be. Then search with a clear aim.
msgctxt "lesson:toys_5#content"
msgid ""
"Bei Toys lohnt sich Qualität. Billigware aus fragwürdigen Quellen ist häufig aus schlechtem Material und bietet keine Sicherheit.\n"
"\n"
"Wo kaufen\n"
