#. EN: The task
#. EN: One person is blindfolded and has their wrists loosely tied to the bed. For the agreed time, the focus is on receiving. They do not have to perform; brief check-ins and stopping remain possible at any time. Fifteen minutes is a guide, not an obligation. Then untie, cover up, hold. Only then do you talk about it.
