#. Soforthilfe-Karte (SOS)
#. EN: Ask each other: what was good for us? What would I like to be different next time?
msgctxt "sos:sos_danach#steps.3"
msgid "Fragt euch beide: Was hat uns gutgetan? Was wünsche ich mir beim nächsten Mal anders?"
msgstr ""

